{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "planner",
  "title": "秘書提醒",
  "description": "每 5 分鐘照排程檔發提醒：秘書頻道的早報、晚間回顧、每週回顧（在秘書的排程檔裡，秘書自己能改），和其他頻道自己寫的提醒。",
  "pitch": "每天固定時間叫秘書頻道 #secretary 的 Claude 寫早報、晚間回顧、每週回顧，也讓各頻道的 Claude 幫你設提醒。每次叫醒都會用訂閱額度；時間可以自己選，之後跟秘書說就能改時間或關掉。",
  "keep": "早報、晚間回顧、每週回顧和提醒",
  "lose": "沒有早報、回顧，也不能請 Claude 設提醒",
  "order": 30,
  "machines": "one",
  "channels": [
    {
      "name": "secretary",
      "kind": "claude",
      "setting": "planner.channel",
      "category": "main"
    }
  ],
  "schedules": [
    {
      "name": "remind",
      "when": {
        "every": "5m"
      },
      "do": {
        "run": "/usr/bin/python3 \"{plugin}/remind.py\"",
        "output": "none",
        "log": "~/.cache/planner.out",
        "trace": "~/.cache/remind-state.json"
      }
    }
  ],
  "schedule_files": "{setting:planner.schedule_files}",
  "schedule_files_default": "{data}/planner/reminders.json",
  "data": [
    {
      "name": "remind-state",
      "path": "~/.cache/remind-state.json",
      "sync": "none"
    },
    {
      "name": "reminders",
      "path": "{data}/planner",
      "sync": "timer",
      "private": true
    }
  ]
}
